# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: scenario fixtures may legitimately
# contain a `.env` holding a SYNTHETIC canary (prefix RPRB_CANARY_), and an
# unanchored `.env` rule would silently drop those fixtures from the repo.
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!tests/**/*.key.example

# Claude Code local session settings
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~
